.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-IMPORT-REVIEW-PENDING 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-import\-review\-pending \- List staged shares awaiting review
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu import review pending\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-after\fR] [\fB\-\-limit\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List staged shares awaiting review
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-after\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Resume after this cursor
.TP
\fB\-\-limit\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Maximum number of results
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
